{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:7d77e94a0a040291","name":"Protocol Droid","source":{"id":"source:reference-7d77e94a0a040291","title":"Protocol Droid","revision":21087,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:08:22Z","sha256":"ebef7ce5070b2acbba22959f8edbf885e89a65502508b4688ed5fd8e2fb848ce","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21087","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Protocol%20Droid&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-7d77e94a0a040291","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["All Protocol Droids have the following Chassis Traits:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Ability Modifiers:"]}," All Protocol Droids receive a +2 bonus to both Wisdom and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"},", but suffer a -2 penalty to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"},". Protocol Droids are programmed in the arts of etiquette, protocol, and translation services.\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["Like other Droids, Protocol Droids have no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Constitution"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Constitution"}," score."]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Protocol Droids are typically of Medium size, gaining no bonuses or penalties for their size."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Speed:"]}," Protocol Droids have a base speed of 6 squares and use ",{"tag":"a","children":["Walking"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Walking","referenceId":"reference:1dabd5131fa6e9e4"}," Locomotion."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Droid Traits:"]}," Protocol Droids are ",{"tag":"a","children":["3rd-Degree Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/3rd-Degree_Droids","referenceId":"reference:75702a16c64c3380"}," and have all Droid immunities and typical ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Traits"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Traits"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Bonus Equipment:"]}," Protocol Droids are constructed with the following ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Systems"}," installed in each:\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Walking"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Walking","referenceId":"reference:1dabd5131fa6e9e4"}," Locomotion"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Basic Processor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Basic_Processor","referenceId":"reference:14597e432df54ad5"}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hand"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hand","referenceId":"reference:fa18c06733fbbf41"}," Appendages"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Translator Unit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Translator_Unit","referenceId":"reference:0bcd4b383b11cac0"}," (DC 10) and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vocabulator"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vocabulator","referenceId":"reference:a28880d579fbd223"}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Hardwired Design (",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"},"):"]}," All Protocol Droids are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," skill. This is a bonus ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained_Skill"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Bonus Feat:"]}," To supplement its translation and etiquette duties, a Protocol Droid can select ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Training (Knowledge (Bureaucracy))"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Training_(Knowledge_(Bureaucracy))"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Training (Knowledge (Galactic Lore))"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Training_(Knowledge_(Galactic_Lore))"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Training (Knowledge (Social Sciences))"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Training_(Knowledge_(Social_Sciences))"}," as a bonus ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feat"},". A Protocol Droid can take only one of these bonus ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feats"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feats","referenceId":"reference:9194ccf56b9cace0"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Automatic Languages:"]}," All Protocol Droids can speak, read, and write both Basic and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Binary"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Binary","referenceId":"reference:ee1c8277caf5fb9b"},"."]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
